<title>UK: Copper moving away from lows in LME PM.</title>
<headline>Copper moving away from lows in LME PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Maintains midsession bounce from lows, but inhibited near $2,350. Cash/threes at $72/77 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Holds little changed. Eyes $1,640 overhead. trade selling. ALLOY - Slack.</p>
<p>ZINC - Quiet, indicated steadier. LEAD - Dull, quoted higher.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Holds $7,300. TIN - Steadier.</p>
</text>
